WEBVTT

00:18.085 --> 00:19.313
Wow...

00:21.488 --> 00:22.648
Look, Poe.

00:22.723 --> 00:24.247
Isn't it pretty?

00:24.325 --> 00:26.793
I can do this without using matches.

00:26.860 --> 00:28.487
See? Look.

00:48.148 --> 00:49.172
Mama...

00:49.249 --> 00:51.444
Look, Mama. Isn't it pretty?

00:56.557 --> 00:57.524
Mama?

01:00.160 --> 01:01.127
Devil...

01:02.630 --> 01:06.532
Episode 19
Inferno

01:17.711 --> 01:18.678
Oh?

01:18.746 --> 01:19.974
Mr. Aoki...

01:26.286 --> 01:27.480
Excuse me.

01:27.554 --> 01:28.782
Yes?

01:28.856 --> 01:30.619
Um, I'd like to submit this...

01:30.691 --> 01:32.386
Divorce papers, I see.

01:33.527 --> 01:36.018
Well, are you filing this yourself?

01:36.096 --> 01:37.063
Yes.

01:40.701 --> 01:42.168
Um, well...

01:42.236 --> 01:44.067
Can I really accept this?

01:45.639 --> 01:49.803
I mean you seem to be slightly hesitant about this, so...

01:51.178 --> 01:52.907
If you're still debating, I'll return this to you.

01:55.416 --> 01:57.941
I'm honored that you'd worry so much.

01:58.018 --> 01:59.815
But it's all right.

01:59.887 --> 02:01.718
I've already made up my mind.

02:05.993 --> 02:07.756
So you're another one...

02:08.796 --> 02:11.356
Concerning the End of the World...

02:11.432 --> 02:12.694
I see.

02:12.766 --> 02:13.994
Yes.

02:14.068 --> 02:17.231
If you don't mind, how about tonight?

02:17.304 --> 02:18.532
Tonight?

02:18.605 --> 02:19.867
Yes.

02:19.940 --> 02:22.170
11:00 at Tokyo Station.

02:23.410 --> 02:24.877
Understood.

02:24.945 --> 02:27.243
Then I will accept this.

02:27.314 --> 02:28.281
Thank you.

02:36.023 --> 02:37.149
Mr. Aoki...

02:55.342 --> 02:56.309
What's wrong?

02:57.911 --> 03:00.675
The Kamui of the Dragons of Earth told me...

03:00.748 --> 03:04.081
That you would be able to find out what I really am.

03:05.886 --> 03:08.320
What meaning is there in finding out?

03:09.356 --> 03:11.085
I don't know.

03:11.158 --> 03:12.125
But...

03:16.363 --> 03:18.297
Oh, Mr. Aoki.

03:18.365 --> 03:22.859
Someone named Ms. Kasumi from Flower called you before.

03:22.936 --> 03:24.369
She said to call her back.

03:25.405 --> 03:27.236
Flower? You mean that...

03:27.307 --> 03:28.638
Y-Yes...

03:28.709 --> 03:30.540
Is this for real, Mr. Aoki?

03:30.611 --> 03:33.910
N-No, it's not like that at all.

03:33.981 --> 03:38.884
Oh, sending such a serious guy like Mr. Aoki to a place like that...

03:38.952 --> 03:40.419
...really was a bad idea!

03:40.487 --> 03:44.287
They say serious people are more at risk for falling for it.

03:44.358 --> 03:45.950
I-It's not that!

03:46.026 --> 03:47.960
I just went there for work!

03:48.028 --> 03:48.995
For work!

03:49.062 --> 03:53.158
Come to think of it, I recall you coming back pretty happy then.

03:53.233 --> 03:55.428
Yeah, that's true.

03:55.502 --> 03:57.060
I-Impossible.

03:57.137 --> 03:58.798
T-That's...

03:58.872 --> 04:01.306
That's because... Probably...

04:01.809 --> 04:03.868
FLOWER - Aesthetician-style

04:03.944 --> 04:05.878
Is this what you needed?

04:05.946 --> 04:07.106
Yes.

04:07.181 --> 04:10.173
It's valuable information that can be heard...

04:10.250 --> 04:11.911
...only from industry people.

04:11.985 --> 04:14.385
I'm sure my artist will be very happy.

04:14.454 --> 04:17.855
It must be hard working in publishing...

04:17.925 --> 04:20.325
Coming out here for research.

04:20.394 --> 04:22.453
Artists are very busy people...

04:22.529 --> 04:25.965
...so it's my job as editor to help any way I can.

04:27.668 --> 04:28.692
I see.

04:28.769 --> 04:31.795
By the way, do you have a family?

04:31.872 --> 04:33.635
I have a wife and daughter.

04:33.707 --> 04:35.197
Just as I thought.

04:35.275 --> 04:38.972
All the good men are always married.

04:39.046 --> 04:41.105
Oh, it's already this late?

04:42.783 --> 04:46.310
Are you sure you only need to talk to me?

04:46.386 --> 04:48.251
Well, um, I...

04:48.322 --> 04:50.916
You think I'd let you go with just a chat?

04:52.259 --> 04:53.783
Just kidding.

04:53.861 --> 04:57.422
You think dearly of your wife and daughter, don't you.

04:57.497 --> 05:01.263
Yes, they're the family I want to protect above all else.

05:01.335 --> 05:04.600
I'm jealous of such a family.

05:04.671 --> 05:07.367
It's something I've never had...

05:07.441 --> 05:10.968
Oh, sorry to bog you down like this.

05:11.044 --> 05:12.841
N-Not at all...

05:12.913 --> 05:14.881
It was fun today.

05:14.948 --> 05:17.917
Next time, come as a customer.

05:17.985 --> 05:19.350
I'll be extra special.

05:19.419 --> 05:20.852
S-Sure...

05:21.889 --> 05:24.221
It's true she was a charming person...

05:25.659 --> 05:27.684
But that was it.

05:27.761 --> 05:29.888
Hm, kind of suspicious...

05:29.963 --> 05:33.228
Yeah, definitely suspicious.

05:33.300 --> 05:36.428
One of the Dragons of Heaven, Seiichiro Aoki?

05:36.503 --> 05:37.561
Yes.

05:37.638 --> 05:40.368
He seemed to be a good family man.

05:40.440 --> 05:43.500
Though he became single again a few moments ago.

05:43.577 --> 05:47.274
In other words, you accepted a challenge from him?

05:48.882 --> 05:50.315
It seems so.

05:50.384 --> 05:51.817
In any case...

05:51.885 --> 05:55.321
...I don't think that Dragon of Heaven will come by himself.

05:55.389 --> 05:57.323
I'll send someone as backup.

05:57.391 --> 05:59.859
No, don't worry about me.

05:59.927 --> 06:02.122
I'm sure he'll come alone.

06:02.195 --> 06:04.095
I'm sure of it.

06:04.164 --> 06:06.564
Well, I'll contact you again later.

06:08.969 --> 06:10.732
I found something out.

06:10.804 --> 06:12.271
About who you are.

06:14.741 --> 06:16.971
Tojo Pharmaceuticals' president...

06:17.044 --> 06:21.378
...had a granddaughter named Kazuki who died from illness.

06:21.448 --> 06:25.316
Soon afterwards, her father committed suicide.

06:25.385 --> 06:29.617
Tojo Pharmaceuticals began clone research around that time.

06:29.690 --> 06:32.420
In other words, the president, Tojo...

06:32.492 --> 06:37.520
...tried to recreate his heirs using Kazuki's womb and her father.

06:38.565 --> 06:41.125
That's what Beast decided to be the case.

06:42.536 --> 06:44.731
I am Kazuki?

06:44.805 --> 06:47.865
You're Kazuki, and you're also her father.

06:47.941 --> 06:49.602
Why do such a thing?

06:49.676 --> 06:50.870
For what purpose?

06:50.944 --> 06:53.811
Well, I don't know that much.

06:53.880 --> 06:54.847
Let's see.

06:55.983 --> 06:59.077
It's hard to understand what people do.

06:59.152 --> 07:02.144
I'm sure Beast can't find an answer, either.

07:02.222 --> 07:03.883
Before that, Nataku...

07:03.957 --> 07:07.393
I have a favor to ask.
Is it all right?

07:10.697 --> 07:12.824
Um, this is Aoki...

07:12.899 --> 07:16.892
Oh, sorry for calling you at work.

07:16.970 --> 07:18.460
No, It's all right.

07:18.538 --> 07:20.096
Did something happen?

07:20.173 --> 07:23.973
Yes, I have something I want to discuss.

07:24.044 --> 07:25.272
If you don't mind...

07:25.345 --> 07:28.508
...can you come over to my place after work?

07:28.582 --> 07:30.072
To your house?

07:30.150 --> 07:33.415
I'm sure I'm troubling you with such a sudden request.

07:33.487 --> 07:36.752
No, I can make it if it's around 9:00...

07:36.823 --> 07:38.188
I'm glad.

07:38.258 --> 07:40.283
Then I'll be waiting.

07:40.360 --> 07:41.327
All right.

07:56.243 --> 07:57.403
Why...

07:57.477 --> 08:00.139
Why was a devil like you born from me?

08:00.213 --> 08:01.680
I won't do it again, Mama!

08:01.748 --> 08:04.911
If you weren't here, I wouldn't have to hide like this!

08:04.985 --> 08:06.612
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

08:06.686 --> 08:08.551
I won't be fooled anymore, devil.

08:08.622 --> 08:11.591
Nobody would be sad if you weren't here!

08:11.658 --> 08:13.592
- Even if I died?
- That's right!

08:13.660 --> 08:15.059
Nobody will cry!

08:15.128 --> 08:16.595
Why would they bother?

08:19.833 --> 08:21.994
Mama, what's wrong?

08:22.069 --> 08:23.058
Mama!

08:23.136 --> 08:24.330
Mama!

08:24.404 --> 08:26.269
What's wrong, Mama?

08:26.339 --> 08:27.533
Mama!

08:27.607 --> 08:29.131
Mama!

08:29.209 --> 08:31.973
Mama!

08:43.757 --> 08:46.920
I'm sorry for calling you out like this.

08:46.993 --> 08:48.460
Not at all.

08:48.528 --> 08:50.655
Can you sit there for a while?

08:50.730 --> 08:51.697
Sure.

08:56.103 --> 08:59.561
It looks like you've taken good care of this friend.

09:01.141 --> 09:03.302
Oh, that's true.

09:03.376 --> 09:05.503
It's the only family I have.

09:06.813 --> 09:07.871
Here.

09:07.948 --> 09:09.074
Thank you.

09:10.117 --> 09:11.982
I heard about Mr. Saiki...

09:13.019 --> 09:14.850
What a pity it was...

09:16.189 --> 09:20.250
I heard that he was your nephew.

09:20.327 --> 09:22.625
I'm sure you were hit the hardest.

09:22.696 --> 09:23.856
I feel your pain.

09:25.665 --> 09:29.123
Daisuke made me promise...

09:30.170 --> 09:32.138
...not to cry if he died.

09:33.540 --> 09:38.307
He decided to protect Princess Hinoto when he was very young.

09:38.378 --> 09:41.313
So he told me not to cry when he died...

09:41.381 --> 09:45.750
...because that'd be when he protected her till the very end.

09:45.819 --> 09:48.083
When did you make that promise?

09:48.155 --> 09:50.020
When he was 13.

09:51.825 --> 09:56.194
It's hard to not be able to cry when a loved one passes away.

09:56.263 --> 09:59.255
You mustn't force a promise like that onto others.

10:00.300 --> 10:01.733
All right.

10:01.801 --> 10:05.066
By the way, are your wife and daughter doing well?

10:05.138 --> 10:08.972
Yes, but considering the battle to come...

10:09.042 --> 10:11.306
...I need to prepare for the worst.

10:11.378 --> 10:13.369
Is that why you filed for divorce?

10:14.414 --> 10:15.642
I'm sorry.

10:15.715 --> 10:18.377
I was right there at that time.

10:18.451 --> 10:20.942
I was submitting a change of address form.

10:21.021 --> 10:23.512
I-I see.

10:23.590 --> 10:26.150
You could have said hello.

10:26.226 --> 10:30.356
I was about to, but you seemed very solemn.

10:31.398 --> 10:32.831
I'm sorry.

10:32.899 --> 10:35.493
I finally decided on divorce...

10:35.569 --> 10:39.164
...so I wouldn't get my family involved in all of this.

10:39.239 --> 10:42.606
But when this Final Battle is over...

10:42.676 --> 10:45.201
And if I remain alive...

10:45.278 --> 10:48.270
I'll make sure to marry my wife again.

10:48.348 --> 10:49.508
I see...

10:49.583 --> 10:51.448
That's a relief.

10:51.518 --> 10:53.179
I'm so glad.

10:53.253 --> 10:56.279
So that must be what you wanted to discuss.

10:56.356 --> 10:58.654
I'm sorry to have made you worry.

11:00.126 --> 11:01.923
I have to go back soon.

11:01.995 --> 11:03.724
Please excuse me.

11:05.732 --> 11:07.290
Wait.

11:07.367 --> 11:08.629
You can't go back.

11:13.640 --> 11:16.268
I'll go to Tokyo Station.

11:16.343 --> 11:19.710
No, I promised I would go alone.

11:19.779 --> 11:20.768
No.

11:20.847 --> 11:22.906
You have a family.

11:22.983 --> 11:26.942
There are many who'd grieve if something happened to you.

11:27.020 --> 11:28.385
For you as well...

11:28.455 --> 11:30.480
I don't have anyone.

11:30.557 --> 11:32.923
There's nobody who would cry for me.

11:32.993 --> 11:34.255
That can't be...

11:34.327 --> 11:38.354
The reason I had you come was because I wanted to tell you that.

11:38.431 --> 11:40.490
You have people waiting for you.

11:40.567 --> 11:43.695
Kamui and the other youngsters have a future.

11:43.770 --> 11:46.364
So I should be the first to face danger...

11:46.439 --> 11:50.569
...because no one would be sad if something happened to me.

11:50.644 --> 11:53.738
Did you think I'd say yes to that?

11:53.813 --> 11:55.075
I didn't.

11:55.148 --> 11:58.982
That's why I fooled around with your tea.

11:59.052 --> 12:00.485
Karen...

12:10.163 --> 12:13.326
Poe, guard Mr. Aoki.

12:13.400 --> 12:16.392
I'll have things all settled by the time he wakes up.

12:27.981 --> 12:28.948
Oh?

12:31.718 --> 12:33.652
There's still 15 more minutes...

12:33.720 --> 12:35.017
Hasty person.

13:03.216 --> 13:05.150
Are you alone?

13:05.218 --> 13:08.346
I was expecting the one who works at the ward office.

13:09.356 --> 13:12.723
You are not the one I was waiting for, either.

13:12.792 --> 13:15.818
In other words, we're both taking someone else's place.

13:16.863 --> 13:18.660
However, breaking the Barriers...

13:18.732 --> 13:21.223
...is the wish of the Kamui of the Dragons of Earth.

13:21.301 --> 13:23.201
I will abide by that.

13:23.269 --> 13:24.236
I see.

13:28.908 --> 13:30.808
Hasty people aren't well-liked!

13:41.688 --> 13:43.315
Will you go on?

13:43.390 --> 13:45.620
You must not like dying, right?

13:45.692 --> 13:48.354
Stop trying to break the Barriers.

13:49.429 --> 13:52.227
Why must I dislike dying?

13:53.266 --> 13:55.826
I do not have such feelings.

14:09.015 --> 14:10.539
Your eyes...

14:10.617 --> 14:12.141
Just like a lost child.

14:13.520 --> 14:15.715
Lost child?

14:16.756 --> 14:18.155
That's right.

14:18.224 --> 14:19.782
Because I was like that.

14:20.827 --> 14:23.159
These things saith he...

14:23.229 --> 14:27.632
...that holdeth the seven stars in his right hand.

14:28.835 --> 14:31.998
I know thy works and thy labour.

14:33.706 --> 14:35.298
What's wrong?

14:35.375 --> 14:37.570
Pray for your mother.

14:37.644 --> 14:39.236
Now come over here.

14:43.883 --> 14:45.009
What's the matter?

14:54.761 --> 14:56.626
I'm a devil!

14:56.696 --> 14:58.561
Can you get rid of me?

14:58.631 --> 15:00.531
Try it if you can.

15:00.600 --> 15:02.932
Though you might burn to death.

15:03.002 --> 15:04.196
Are you surprised?

15:04.270 --> 15:05.999
Y-Yes...

15:06.072 --> 15:08.973
Are you scared of a devil, after all?

15:09.042 --> 15:10.839
Of course.

15:10.910 --> 15:13.071
Everyone is afraid.

15:13.146 --> 15:14.340
However, a devil...

15:16.349 --> 15:18.749
...doesn't have eyes full of fear like that.

15:19.786 --> 15:21.913
My mother said I was a devil!

15:21.988 --> 15:24.923
She said this power was the devil's power!

15:25.959 --> 15:27.722
I don't think so.

15:28.995 --> 15:33.125
Power is something that can be used for good or evil...

15:33.199 --> 15:35.724
...depending on how one uses it.

15:37.070 --> 15:39.971
I don't know the meaning of that power.

15:40.039 --> 15:43.873
However, I believe that it was something the Lord gave you...

15:43.943 --> 15:46.537
...when you were born into this world.

15:46.613 --> 15:49.878
I'm sure He will guide you to the answer in time.

15:49.949 --> 15:50.916
You're lying.

15:50.984 --> 15:52.645
I'm a devil!

15:54.621 --> 15:58.387
To me, all you are is a lost, little lamb...

16:13.706 --> 16:15.765
Believe in yourself.

16:15.842 --> 16:21.007
And wait patiently until the Lord shows you the answer.

16:31.624 --> 16:34.286
Now let us pray together.

16:36.663 --> 16:40.929
It's tough not knowing what you really are...

16:43.836 --> 16:47.670
There's no such thing as a creature with no emotions.

16:47.740 --> 16:50.208
I'm sure you have emotions, too.

17:01.521 --> 17:04.046
Is Mr. Aoki unable to make it?

17:04.123 --> 17:06.421
I made an appointment with him.

17:06.492 --> 17:10.792
Yes, he had a sudden change of plans, so I came in his place.

17:10.863 --> 17:11.955
Disappointed?

17:12.031 --> 17:13.521
No.

17:13.600 --> 17:15.397
You use water...

17:15.468 --> 17:17.595
My makeup will be ruined.

17:17.670 --> 17:21.367
I'm sure you're more beautiful without makeup.

17:21.441 --> 17:23.204
Thanks.

17:23.276 --> 17:27.303
I'm tired now because I haven't done water tricks in a while.

17:27.380 --> 17:29.143
I must be getting old.

17:29.215 --> 17:31.877
Oh, you must still be young.

17:31.951 --> 17:33.612
I just try to look it.

17:35.288 --> 17:36.687
This is pretty.

17:36.756 --> 17:38.883
Oh no, this is nothing.

17:47.433 --> 17:49.867
You really are much younger than I am.

17:50.870 --> 17:53.930
I lost speed after being barred by your fire.

17:54.974 --> 17:57.807
If you dodge, no good comes out of it for me.

17:57.877 --> 18:00.209
It was coincidence that I dodged that.

18:00.279 --> 18:01.473
You're being modest.

18:11.724 --> 18:13.589
You couldn't dodge this time.

18:14.627 --> 18:16.618
How beautiful...

18:16.696 --> 18:18.994
Like a flower that blooms underwater.

18:30.276 --> 18:31.402
Mr. Aoki!

18:35.214 --> 18:37.978
You came just like you promised.

18:38.051 --> 18:39.712
I knew you would.

18:41.220 --> 18:44.621
But you don't seem to be in the best condition.

18:45.825 --> 18:48.419
My friend here is hurt, as well.

18:48.494 --> 18:51.827
Since we both need to take care of our partners...

18:51.898 --> 18:55.026
...how about we call it a draw for now?

18:55.101 --> 18:56.090
All right.

18:56.169 --> 18:58.637
But when we continue this...

18:58.705 --> 19:01.037
...I would like you to ask for me.

19:02.075 --> 19:03.269
I'll remember that.

19:03.342 --> 19:04.309
See you.

19:09.916 --> 19:11.611
That wound...

19:11.684 --> 19:15.586
You did it yourself to wake up from the medication.

19:16.789 --> 19:20.691
I borrowed the fruit knife in your room...

19:20.760 --> 19:22.625
Why did you do such a thing?

19:22.695 --> 19:25.630
Your wife would be worried about you!

19:25.698 --> 19:28.599
That's exactly what I want to say.

19:29.602 --> 19:33.402
If you were to pass away, nobody would cry...

19:33.473 --> 19:35.907
Do you really mean it when you say that?

19:37.977 --> 19:40.502
I'm not good at being angry...

19:40.580 --> 19:43.708
...but if you think like you did earlier...

19:43.783 --> 19:45.910
And go off by yourself again...

19:45.985 --> 19:48.453
I will be very angry.

19:51.524 --> 19:54.721
Got that, Karen?

19:54.794 --> 19:56.159
Mr. Aoki!

19:56.229 --> 20:00.757
I'll take a little nap here...

20:10.777 --> 20:13.371
Now let us pray together.
